+## Tasks & Acceptance
+
+1. Constants + procs in `crisis.odin` (factor/predicate/mix) — unit-pinned (Given/When/Then in the test file).
+2. Wire the three draw passes (`draw_world` threading; both straight + routed branches in `draw_bundles`; node washes/rings; packet bodies).
+3. Palcheck section 7 + a11y pair floors.
+4. W3 test + W1/W2 mirror refresh.
+5. Gates: `odin test app` (46), `odin test app/render` (83+new), `odin test core`, `tools/lint.sh`, `tools/harness.sh palcheck`.
+6. `tools/harness.sh run` — expect EXACTLY the crisis-frame T2 diffs; all T1/log.bin/calm frames byte-identical (git status proof); deliberate re-bless of the differing demos; re-run green.
+7. Mutation legs (RED-then-GREEN, in the report): delete the desat branch (factor forced 0) ⇒ palcheck section 7 fails; flip W3 inline default ⇒ W3 leg fails.
+
+## Design Notes
+
+- Canvas-mix (not gray-mix): the board's calm register IS the warm paper — gray pipes would read COLDER than the board and stick out the other way. Hue families survive at reduced chroma.
+- The router LED + warning family stay saturated: warm = danger is the telegraph canon; receding warnings would break never-color-alone redundancy during the exact moment it matters. (r1 hardening: the congestion HALO blends from the RAW tier color — the first cut let the receded band drag the halo ~37% toward canvas, silently violating this note.)
+- Snap-back on resolve: the color flood IS the "you fixed it" read; it also makes the byte-identity contract hold at every resolved capture (surge@119500ms stays blessed).
+- Earliest-resolve dip (r1, pinned decision): when the earliest of overlapping zone crises resolves inside another's 16-tick ramp, the phase basis switches to the surviving row's own onset — the factor dips then re-ramps (a partial-relief read for the crisis that DID end). Inherent to the pure rows+tick derivation; a monotone hold needs view-owned history, which the golden capture-path contract forbids. Pinned in `crisis_desat_factor_purity` so it is a decision, not an accident.
+- Receded riders dim their GLINTS (r1): the sparkle field at full strength on receded packets fought the desat — the packet recedes as a unit (`glint_a` scales by `crisis_recede_scale`).
